---@field ServiceRole aws.emr.XmlString The IAM role that the Amazon EMR Studio assumes. The service role provides a way for Amazon EMR Studio to interoperate with other Amazon Web Services services.
---@field UserRole? aws.emr.XmlString The IAM user role that users and groups assume when logged in to an Amazon EMR Studio. Only specify a UserRole when you use IAM Identity Center authentication. The permissions attached to the UserRole can be scoped down for each user or group using session policies.
---@field WorkspaceSecurityGroupId aws.emr.XmlStringMaxLen256 The ID of the Amazon EMR Studio Workspace security group. The Workspace security group allows outbound network traffic to resources in the Engine security group, and it must be in the same VPC specified by VpcId.
---@field EngineSecurityGroupId aws.emr.XmlStringMaxLen256 The ID of the Amazon EMR Studio Engine security group. The Engine security group allows inbound network traffic from the Workspace security group, and it must be in the same VPC specified by VpcId.
---@field DefaultS3Location aws.emr.XmlString The Amazon S3 location to back up Amazon EMR Studio Workspaces and notebook files.
---@field IdpAuthUrl? aws.emr.XmlString The authentication endpoint of your identity provider (IdP). Specify this value when you use IAM authentication and want to let federated users log in to a Studio with the Studio URL and credentials from your IdP. Amazon EMR Studio redirects users to this endpoint to enter credentials.
---@field IdpRelayStateParameterName? aws.emr.XmlStringMaxLen256 The name that your identity provider (IdP) uses for its RelayState parameter. For example, RelayState or TargetSource. Specify this value when you use IAM authentication and want to let federated users log in to a Studio using the Studio URL. The RelayState parameter differs by IdP.
---@field Tags? aws.emr.TagList A list of tags to associate with the Amazon EMR Studio. Tags are user-defined key-value pairs that consist of a required key string with a maximum of 128 characters, and an optional value string with a maximum of 256 characters.
