---@field IdcUserAssignment? aws.emr.IdcUserAssignment|string Specifies whether IAM Identity Center user assignment is REQUIRED or OPTIONAL. If the value is set to REQUIRED, users must be explicitly assigned to the Studio application to access the Studio.
---@field IdcInstanceArn? aws.emr.ArnType The ARN of the IAM Identity Center instance to create the Studio application.
---@field EncryptionKeyArn? aws.emr.XmlString The KMS key identifier (ARN) used to encrypt Amazon EMR Studio workspace and notebook files when backed up to Amazon S3.

